1
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:15,200
Living Market shows how currencies are behaving right now.

2
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:22,300
The top left tells you which trading session is open.

3
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:30,000
The top right explains what the map is showing.

4
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:36,800
Each circle is a currency. The number is how much it has moved.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,700
Green means it is getting stronger, red means weaker.

6
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:53,000
Pick a pair on the map and you can trade it from here.

7
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:59,000
Trading takes you back.

